\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces Bounded proxy-ray refinement at fixed package temperatures 300/270/240/220/221\,K and 300\,K reservoirs. Left: maximum absolute correction applied to a view factor during reciprocal closure. Right: resulting die gas and radiation heat input. These are deterministic refinement diagnostics, not statistical uncertainty bands or native-cavity error estimates.}}{24}{figure.17}\protected@file@percent }
